flowchart TD
 Request[GET /posts?search=...] --> Query[Newest-first query with user and tags]
 Query --> Auth{Authenticated?}
 Auth -->|No| Guest[Filter visibility = published]
 Auth -->|Yes| User[Published OR owned by current user]
 Guest --> Search[Optional title/content/author substring search]
 User --> Search
 Search --> Page[Paginate 10, preserve query string]
 Page --> Render[Render Posts/Index]
 Render --> Gap[⚠️ Vue page is currently missing]
